[{"id":164810697,"discussion_id":"d8529927632a928007a1e6f7379d9d5414f1dbb2","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| matmul | ✅ [*sxb154714*](https://gitcode.com/sxb154714), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*sxb154714*](https://gitcode.com/sxb154714), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:18:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T16:52:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164810731,"discussion_id":"fac89e911a01c17c0fe015277ddcefd9cdab23ce","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:18:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:18:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164811109,"discussion_id":"1747b1e8e1d488b039e231a72bea122e20b678c1","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了矩阵乘法（GEMM）操作在块尾处理（Epilogue）阶段的一个潜在流水线同步问题。该问题在特定条件下（如启用ReLU激活函数）可能导致数据竞争或结果不一致，因为计算结果可能在尚未完全同步时就被写入全局内存。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在块尾处理的`Run`函数中，于执行ReLU激活函数之后、将数据从本地内存复制到全局内存之前，插入了一个全流水线屏障（`AscendC::PipeBarrier<PIPE_ALL>()`）。此修改确保了所有计算单元的结果在数据拷贝前均已就绪并同步，从而保证了数据写入的正确性和一致性。","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:20:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:20:17+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164894962,"discussion_id":"7e1113c4577f5781323b518c78cdf5a3bb8af646","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-11T10:54:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T10:54:16+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164949263,"discussion_id":"50b5d3082be484742a22c78e2e6c7911af1c01f1","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-11T16:56:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T16:56:19+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f